(
    id: "cache_coherence",
    name: "Cache Coherence",
    description: "Read the sector's cache fabric without corrupting it. Unlocks the Cache Tap, which draws Cache Grain, and the Line Driver it pays for. Everything a second sector is built out of starts here.",
